82236066928451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LuOv7Ho0PZQQ7kNvwG95zoE&_nc_oc=AdrFZgQ4o7iUrMEhOiJ0Cw70sOPTMVmmLiVdDazMBtqyr7NMQpTC7YMFrHE4u2Ba6xQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_uIAdRJKbSI0doSUnLc3ejOkTE05v_S2jKMPIZdd_BHg&oe=6A43C6FF"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Media Storage_Screenshot.png", "id": "3267266376829151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OcQzjaX6XrwQ7kNvwHQuAvz&_nc_oc=AdobEWcDRENwMOim02lNald7QkF10M_vTtWdBaBctDUp5ubCnFj3TxuWJ678QkeM-94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8nAyQ7wr48dfQjInD8Rvy5Y3uGhKf2qjyENI83HXLJ1g&oe=6A43E056"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DLTxDXVxYIgQ7kNvwHS1nbV&_nc_oc=AdrVuD2tJ8Q0zpID9IOaJ5PeAElc3dLT3W1IKI1_Z2gUvEVPmNGGj4KG9DCB_pqJGbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-6Y_nvT_hl9J9DVuX9IWXwvb8mGe4bfKhTsnqYZY0QCQ&oe=6A43D73D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h-6mxkckINAQ7kNvwEbxOLV&_nc_oc=AdpkjC_TvVerHs5JHqW7fAxRAK1YrwSU9Yvr7O-R2eNLNAYsVhhR-RQFYP6Hv1bbQDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-QaSmA1MWVvYUY4kHU50h-SP2IOoPSGqoiXXVGeUrUhw&oe=6A43CA55"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0jc1L1Vp1Y8Q7kNvwHUxYbg&_nc_oc=Adoqn_vYnv6Px1L04sb6Bg4OUZFoc1ZU7i8bg3Shv8-E-sc9Rfkt3DIEpmV1VQvfNL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-bab0cPL